eo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:10:#  Electra CPU-output cvars (NOT the -dpcvars launch option, which crashes):\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:11:#    [SystemSettings]\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:12:#    Electra.Win.H264UseOldOutputPath=1\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:13:#    Electra.Win.H265UseOldOutputPath=1\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:14:#  See WORKING-AND-BROKEN-GAMES.md for the exact per-game setup.\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:15:#\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:16:#  USAGE:\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:17:#    1. Duplicate your CrossOver.app (keep the original pristine).\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:18:#    2. Run:  ./patch.sh /path/to/CrossOver-copy.app  [bottle ...]\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:19:#       - no bottle args  -> patches the APP + EVERY existing bottle\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:20:#       - bottle args      -> patches the APP + only those bottles\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:21:#\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:22:#  STAGING (no admin / no Full Disk Access needed): if the path you pass does\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:23:#  NOT end in \".app\" (e.g. \".../CrossOver-winevideo\"), it is treated as a plain\nTools/CrossOverWinevideoPatcher/winevideo Patcher.app/Contents/Resources/patch.sh:24:#  staging folder. macOS \"App Management\" only protects re